{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-opcache","title":"性能与 OPcache","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/php-modern-backend/practice/performance-opcache","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能与-opcache\">性能与 OPcache</h1><p>PHP 的性能优化有一个清晰的层级，理解这个层级比盲目调参重要得多。回到 <a href=\"../foundations/request-lifecycle\">请求生命周期与 SAPI</a> 讲的模型：每个请求都要把 PHP 脚本读进来、编译成 opcode、再执行。这意味着「编译」这件事在没有缓存时每个请求都要重做一遍——这正是 OPcache 要消灭的浪费。在 OPcache 之上，preloading 把热代码常驻内存，JIT 再把 opcode 进一步编译成机器码。这一节讲清这三级杠杆各自解决什么、收益边界在哪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PHP 的执行分两步：先把源码编译成 opcode（操作码，一种中间表示），再由 Zend 引擎逐条执行 opcode。性能优化的三级杠杆分别作用在不同环节：OPcache 缓存编译结果（省掉重复编译）、preloading 在启动时把核心类常驻（省掉自动加载查找）、JIT 把热点 opcode 编译成原生机器码（省掉解释执行开销）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[PHP 源码] --&gt; B[词法/语法分析]&#10;  B --&gt; C[编译为 opcode]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Zend 引擎执行 opcode]&#10;  C -.OPcache 缓存编译结果.-&gt; E[第二次请求跳过编译]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  C -.preloading 启动时常驻核心类.-&gt; F[省掉自动加载与重复编译]&#10;  F --&gt; D&#10;  D -.JIT 把热点 opcode 编译成机器码.-&gt; G[省掉解释执行开销]\">flowchart TD\n  A[PHP 源码] --&gt; B[词法/语法分析]\n  B --&gt; C[编译为 opcode]\n  C --&gt; D[Zend 引擎执行 opcode]\n  C -.OPcache 缓存编译结果.-&gt; E[第二次请求跳过编译]\n  E --&gt; D\n  C -.preloading 启动时常驻核心类.-&gt; F[省掉自动加载与重复编译]\n  F --&gt; D\n  D -.JIT 把热点 opcode 编译成机器码.-&gt; G[省掉解释执行开销]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>作用环节</th>\n<th>解决的浪费</th>\n<th>收益边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OPcache</td>\n<td>缓存 opcode</td>\n<td>每请求重复编译</td>\n<td>几乎所有应用都该开，收益巨大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preloading</td>\n<td>启动时常驻类</td>\n<td>自动加载查找 + 重复编译</td>\n<td>大型框架收益明显（启动快 ~60%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT</td>\n<td>opcode→机器码</td>\n<td>解释执行开销</td>\n<td>CPU 密集型大，I/O 密集型小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"opcache-最划算的优化\">OPcache：最划算的优化</h2><p>OPcache 是 PHP 自带的扩展，几乎是「免费的午餐」——它把每个 PHP 文件第一次编译出的 opcode 缓存在共享内存里，后续请求直接复用，跳过整个编译阶段。在 shared-nothing 模型下，这意味着哪怕每请求都「从零开始」，至少不用「从零编译」。开启 OPcache 通常能让 PHP 应用的吞吐提升数倍，是生产环境的绝对底线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"; php.ini 中的 OPcache 关键配置&#10;opcache.enable=1&#10;opcache.memory_consumption=256          ; 缓存内存，大项目调大&#10;opcache.max_accelerated_files=20000     ; 可缓存文件数，Laravel/Symfony 设 2 万&#10;opcache.validate_timestamps=0           ; 生产关闭：不检查文件改动，需手动清缓存&#10;opcache.revalidate_freq=0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; php.ini 中的 OPcache 关键配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.enable=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.memory_consumption=256          ; 缓存内存，大项目调大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.max_accelerated_files=20000     ; 可缓存文件数，Laravel/Symfony 设 2 万</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.validate_timestamps=0           ; 生产关闭：不检查文件改动，需手动清缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.revalidate_freq=0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最关键的一项是 <code>opcache.validate_timestamps</code>。开发环境设为 <code>1</code>，OPcache 会检查文件是否改动、改了就重新编译，方便调试；生产环境设为 <code>0</code>，OPcache 不再检查时间戳——这能榨出额外性能，但代价是每次部署后必须手动重置 OPcache（重启 PHP-FPM 或调用 <code>opcache_reset()</code>），否则旧代码会一直生效。<code>max_accelerated_files</code> 要设得比项目实际文件数大，否则缓存会溢出失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"preloading-启动即就绪\">Preloading：启动即就绪</h2><p>PHP 7.4 引入的 preloading 在 OPcache 之上更进一步：它在 PHP 进程启动时（而非首次请求时）就把一组指定的类编译并常驻内存，整个进程生命周期内永久可用，连自动加载查找都省了。对 Laravel、Symfony 这种动辄上千个类的框架，preloading 能把应用启动性能提升最高约 60%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"php\" data-code=\"// preload.php —— 在 php.ini 用 opcache.preload=preload.php 指定&#10;$files = glob(__DIR__ . &#39;/vendor/composer/autoload_classmap.php&#39;);&#10;require __DIR__ . &#39;/vendor/autoload.php&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 预加载框架核心与高频业务类&#10;opcache_compile_file(__DIR__ . &#39;/src/Service/OrderService.php&#39;);&#10;// ……按应用的实际热路径定制\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// preload.php —— 在 php.ini 用 opcache.preload=preload.php 指定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$files = glob(__DIR__ . '/vendor/composer/autoload_classmap.php');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require __DIR__ . '/vendor/autoload.php';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 预加载框架核心与高频业务类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache_compile_file(__DIR__ . '/src/Service/OrderService.php');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ……按应用的实际热路径定制</span></span></code></pre></div><p>preloading 的两个注意点：一是它的收益高度依赖「预加载哪些类」——应该预加载真正高频的核心类，而非全部，每个应用的热路径不同，需要定制；二是它增加了进程启动时间（所有预加载脚本在启动时一次性执行），且预加载的类改动后必须重启进程才生效。它与 <a href=\"../modern/composer-psr\">Composer 与 PSR 规范</a> 里讲的 PSR-4 自动加载是互补关系：自动加载是「按需懒加载」，preloading 是「核心类提前常驻」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"jit-把字节码变成机器码\">JIT：把字节码变成机器码</h2><p>JIT（Just-In-Time 编译，PHP 8.0 引入）是性能层级的最高一级：它把热点 opcode 进一步编译成 CPU 原生机器码，跳过 Zend 引擎逐条解释的开销。但 JIT 的收益高度依赖工作负载类型，这是最容易被误解的一点。</p>\n<p>对 CPU 密集型任务（图像处理、数学计算、加密、大量循环），JIT 收益巨大——2026 年的基准测试显示，开启 JIT 的 tracing 模式能让某些 CPU 密集场景的 QPS 提升超过 110%（从 1.76 提升到 3.71 req/s），平均响应时间下降超过 52%。但绝大多数 Web 请求是 I/O 密集型的——大部分时间在等数据库、文件、外部 API，CPU 很少是瓶颈，这时 JIT 的提升往往只有 1%~5%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ini\" data-code=\"; JIT 配置（依赖 OPcache）&#10;opcache.jit_buffer_size=128M&#10;opcache.jit=tracing       ; tracing 模式通常优于 function 模式\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>; JIT 配置（依赖 OPcache）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.jit_buffer_size=128M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opcache.jit=tracing       ; tracing 模式通常优于 function 模式</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用一个简化模型理解：若请求总耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = T_{cpu} + T_{io}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，JIT 只能压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 部分。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{io} \\gg T_{cpu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（典型 Web），整体加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{T}{T_{io} + T_{cpu}/k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4147em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 接近 1；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{cpu} \\gg T_{io}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（计算密集），加速才显著。所以 JIT 不是万能开关——先确认你的瓶颈在 CPU，再开它，否则收益甚微。对 I/O 密集型应用，真正的并发解法是 <a href=\"../modern/async-fibers\">异步与 Fiber</a> 与 worker 运行时，而非 JIT。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优化的正确顺序\">优化的正确顺序</h2><p>把三级杠杆按「性价比」排序，能避免把精力花错地方：第一步永远是开 OPcache（几乎零成本、收益巨大，所有应用都该开）；第二步，若用大型框架且追求启动性能，配置定制化的 preloading；第三步，仅当 profiling 确认瓶颈在 CPU 时才开 JIT。在这之外，别忘了更上层的优化往往收益更大——数据库索引、查询 N+1 消除、缓存层（Redis）、用 worker 运行时摊薄初始化，这些通常比抠 JIT 那几个百分点更值。性能优化的铁律是先测量再优化：用 Xdebug、Blackfire、Tideways 这类 profiler 找到真实瓶颈，再决定动哪一级。瓶颈定位清楚后，安全也别落下，见 <a href=\"security-pitfalls\">安全与陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PHP 执行分「编译成 opcode」与「执行 opcode」两步，三级优化分别作用在不同环节。</li>\n<li>OPcache 缓存编译结果，是几乎零成本、收益巨大的底线；生产关 <code>validate_timestamps</code> 但部署后须重置。</li>\n<li>Preloading（7.4）启动时把核心类常驻，大型框架启动快约 60%，需按热路径定制、改类要重启。</li>\n<li>JIT（8.0）把热点 opcode 编译成机器码：CPU 密集型收益超 100%，I/O 密集型仅 1%~5%。</li>\n<li>优化顺序：先 OPcache → 再按需 preloading → 仅 CPU 瓶颈时开 JIT；先用 profiler 测量再动手。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>数据来源：php.net OPcache 配置文档；PHPBenchLab JIT 基准（phpbenchlab.com，2026）；CloudPanel preloading 指南。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能与 OPcache","id":"性能与-opcache"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OPcache：最划算的优化","id":"opcache-最划算的优化"},{"level":2,"text":"Preloading：启动即就绪","id":"preloading-启动即就绪"},{"level":2,"text":"JIT：把字节码变成机器码","id":"jit-把字节码变成机器码"},{"level":2,"text":"优化的正确顺序","id":"优化的正确顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"框架生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/php-modern-backend/practice/frameworks"},"next":{"title":"安全与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/php-modern-backend/practice/security-pitfalls"}}